@startuml Get_Class_Stats
title Activity Diagram - Get Class Statistics

|Instructor|
start
:Select a class;
:Click "View Statistics";

|Web Application|
:Send request to retrieve\nclass statistics;

|Backend API|
:Validate classId parameter;
:Call ClassStatsService.\nGetClassStatsAsync(classId);
:Query class with:\n- ClassEnrollments (TotalStudents)\n- Groups\n- Projects;
:Query projects status:\n- SubmittedProjects\n- PendingProjects\n- ApprovedProjects\n- RejectedProjects;
:Query MilestoneEvaluations:\n- Calculate average score\n- Count evaluated projects;
:Calculate submission rate:\n= (SubmittedProjects / TotalProjects) * 100;

:Map to ClassStatsResponseDto:\n- ClassId, ClassName\n- TotalStudents\n- TotalProjects\n- SubmittedProjects, PendingProjects\n- ApprovedProjects, RejectedProjects\n- SubmissionRate (%)\n- AverageScore\n- EvaluatedProjects\n- LastSubmissionDate\n- ProjectDetails[];
:Send 200 OK response;

|Web Application|
if (Response successful?) then (yes)
  :Display statistics dashboard:\n- Submission rate chart\n- Average score\n- Project status breakdown\n- Project details table;
else (no)
  :Display error message;
  stop
endif

|Instructor|
:View class statistics;
stop
@enduml

